{"root":"bagal","ipa":"/ba.ɡal/","core":"缓慢的，迟钝的，常用于形容速度或动作慢","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ba.ɡal/","zh":"缓慢的，迟钝的","phrases":[{"t":"gerak bagal","zh":"动作缓慢"},{"t":"paling bagal","zh":"最慢的"},{"t":"terlalu bagal","zh":"太慢了"}],"examples":[{"t":"Kendaraan itu berjalan sangat bagal di jalan raya.","zh":"那辆车在公路上开得很慢。"},{"t":"Komputer ini kinerjanya sangat bagal.","zh":"这台电脑运行速度非常慢。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"bagal","ipa":"/ba.ɡal/","zh":"缓慢的","phrase":{"t":"terlalu bagal","zh":"过于缓慢"},"example":{"t":"Proses ini terlalu bagal.","zh":"这个过程太慢了。"}},{"w":"kebagalan","ipa":"/kə.ba.ɡa.lan/","zh":"迟钝，缓慢","phrase":{"t":"faktor kebagalan","zh":"缓慢因素"},"example":{"t":"Kebagalan sistem membuat pekerjaan tertunda.","zh":"系统的迟钝导致工作延误。"}},{"w":"membagalkan","ipa":"/məm.ba.ɡal.kan/","zh":"使变慢，耽误","phrase":{"t":"membagalkan waktu","zh":"耽误时间"},"example":{"t":"Jangan membagalkan pekerjaan ini.","zh":"不要耽误这项工作。"}},{"w":"kebagalan","ipa":"/kə.ba.ɡa.lan/","zh":"变得迟缓","phrase":{"t":"mengalami kebagalan","zh":"经历迟缓"},"example":{"t":"Jaringan ini mengalami kebagalan.","zh":"这个网络经历了变慢的情况。"}},{"w":"terbagal","ipa":"/tər.ba.ɡal/","zh":"不经意间变慢的","phrase":{"t":"secara terbagal","zh":"以变慢的方式"},"example":{"t":"Laju kendaraan terbagal karena muatan.","zh":"由于载重，车辆速度慢了下来。"}},{"w":"pembagal","ipa":"/pəm.ba.ɡal/","zh":"使变慢的人或物","phrase":{"t":"menjadi pembagal","zh":"成为拖后腿的因素"},"example":{"t":"Dia sering menjadi pembagal dalam tim.","zh":"他经常成为团队里拖后腿的人。"}},{"w":"pembagalan","ipa":"/pəm.ba.ɡa.lan/","zh":"放慢，延缓的过程","phrase":{"t":"pembagalan laju","zh":"减速过程"},"example":{"t":"Pembagalan ekonomi terlihat jelas.","zh":"经济放缓的迹象很明显。"}},{"w":"terbagal-bagal","ipa":"/tər.ba.ɡal.ba.ɡal/","zh":"磨磨蹭蹭的，拖拖拉拉的","phrase":{"t":"berjalan terbagal-bagal","zh":"磨磨蹭蹭地走"},"example":{"t":"Anak itu berjalan terbagal-bagal ke sekolah.","zh":"那个孩子磨磨蹭蹭地走向学校。"}},{"w":"kebagalan-bagalan","ipa":"/kə.ba.ɡa.lan.ba.ɡa.lan/","zh":"有点缓慢的","phrase":{"t":"terasa kebagalan-bagalan","zh":"感觉有点慢"},"example":{"t":"Proses ini tera